  "machineSetting": "machine",
  "_machines_note": "ONE core.wbx, a machine per system Geargrafx emulates; the setting 'machine' picks one. The PC Engine is the first and the default. The four share one controller (a pad, or five through the TurboTap, or the mouse in port 1); their settings say which machines they belong to ('when').",
